WEBVTT

00:10:58.341 --> 00:11:02.044
the first scar that I ever got,

00:11:02.044 --> 00:11:05.158
from my umbilical cord,

00:11:05.158 --> 00:11:08.396
and then around that, is traced

00:11:08.396 --> 00:11:10.892
the last scar that I got

00:11:10.892 --> 00:11:13.269
from my surgeon,

00:11:13.269 --> 00:11:18.583
and I think that, that chance encounter

00:11:18.583 --> 00:11:22.472
with those kids on the street with their knives

00:11:22.472 --> 00:11:24.905
led me

00:11:24.905 --> 00:11:28.030
to my surgical team,

00:11:28.030 --> 00:11:32.105
and their training